---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Renato Molina Toth</title>
    <meta name="description" content="CTO, hands-on technical leader, and software engineer. Building products with craft, leading teams with clarity." />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="noise"></div>
    <div class="bg-glow bg-glow-1"></div>
    <div class="bg-glow bg-glow-2"></div>
    <div class="glow-orb" id="orb"></div>

    <div class="container">
      <nav>
        <a href="/" class="nav-active">About</a>
        <a href="/timeline">Journey</a>
      </nav>

      <header>
        <div class="header-row">
          <img src="/photo.jpg" alt="Renato Molina Toth" class="avatar" />
          <div>
            <h1>Renato <span class="gradient">Molina Toth</span></h1>
            <p class="role-line">Chief Technology Officer & Tech Lead at <a href="https://skillsetter.com" target="_blank">Skillsetter</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="intro">
        <p>A hands-on technical leader who still ships code every day, drives the technical direction, and shapes product strategy alongside the team. CTOs at growing companies wear every hat, and I prefer it that way.</p>
        <p>I've spent 12+ years building software products end-to-end, from embedded Android systems and IoT to modern web platforms. I care deeply about <strong>craft</strong>: clean architecture, agile that actually works, and teams that ship with confidence. I hold my teams to high standards on engineering practices and I'm opinionated about what good software looks like.</p>
        <p>Lately I'm deep in <strong>AI and LLMs</strong>, integrating them into products, understanding their limits, and helping teams adopt them without the hype. I'm also well-versed in <strong>SOC 2</strong> compliance, having built the engineering processes and controls that make security audits boring (the good kind of boring).</p>
        <p>Based in Vancouver, Canada 🇨🇦</p>
      </section>


      <section class="connect">
        <div class="links">
          <a href="https://github.com/renatomolina" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/renatomolinat" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 01-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 112.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer></footer>
    </div>

    <style is:global>
      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

      :root {
        --bg: #07070a;
        --surface: #0d0d12;
        --surface-2: #12121a;
        --border: #1a1a24;
        --border-hover: #2a2a3a;
        --text: #f0f0f2;
        --text-secondary: #a0a0a8;
        --text-muted: #6a6a72;
        --accent: #6366f1;
        --accent-light: #818cf8;
        --accent-glow: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.08);
        --gradient-start: #6366f1;
        --gradient-end: #a855f7;
      }

      html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

      body {
        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
        line-height: 1.7;
        min-height: 100vh;
        overflow-x: hidden;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      .noise {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        opacity: 0.025;
        background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 512 512' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.8' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
        z-index: 9999;
      }

      .bg-glow {
        position: fixed;
        border-radius: 50%;
        pointer-events: none;
        filter: blur(120px);
        z-index: 0;
      }

      .bg-glow-1 {
        width: 700px;
        height: 700px;
        top: -100px;
        right: -200px;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.07) 0%, transparent 70%);
      }

      .bg-glow-2 {
        width: 500px;
        height: 500px;
        bottom: 10%;
        left: -150px;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.05) 0%, transparent 70%);
      }

      .glow-orb {
        position: fixed;
        width: 500px;
        height: 500px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.06) 0%, transparent 60%);
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 0;
        transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        opacity: 1;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 680px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 24px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      nav {
        padding: 40px 0 0;
        display: flex;
        gap: 24px;
      }

      nav a {
        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: 0.01em;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 8px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
        transition: all 0.2s;
      }

      nav a:hover { color: var(--text); }

      nav a.nav-active {
        color: var(--text);
        border-bottom-color: var(--accent);
      }

      header {
        padding: 80px 0 0;
        animation: fadeUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      }

      .header-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 24px;
      }

      .avatar {
        width: 80px;
        height: 80px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        object-fit: cover;
        border: 2px solid var(--border);
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .header-eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      }

      .pulse-dot {
        width: 6px;
        height: 6px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #22c55e;
        animation: pulse 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        line-height: 1.1;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      h1 .gradient {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gradient-start), var(--gradient-end));
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
      }

      .role-line {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      .role-line a {
        color: var(--accent-light);
        text-decoration: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
        transition: border-color 0.2s;
      }

      .role-line a:hover {
        border-bottom-color: var(--accent-light);
      }

      /* Intro */
      .intro {
        padding: 56px 0 0;
        animation: fadeUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.1s both;
      }

      .intro p {
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.9;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        max-width: 600px;
      }

      .intro p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

      .intro p:first-child {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        color: var(--text);
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      .intro strong {
        color: var(--text);
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .intro a {
        color: var(--accent-light);
        text-decoration: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.3);
        transition: border-color 0.2s;
      }

      .intro a:hover {
        border-bottom-color: var(--accent-light);
      }


      /* Connect */
      .connect {
        padding: 48px 0 0;
        animation: fadeUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.3s both;
      }

      .links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .links a {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        background: transparent;
      }

      .links a:hover {
        color: var(--text);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }

      .links a svg {
        width: 20px;
        height: 20px;
      }

      footer {
        padding: 80px 0 40px;
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 13px;
        font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      }

      @keyframes fadeUp {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
        to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
      }

      @keyframes pulse {
        0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
        50% { opacity: 0.4; transform: scale(0.85); }
      }

      @media (max-width: 600px) {
        header { padding: 60px 0 0; }
        .highlight-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .intro-card { padding: 24px; }
      }
    </style>

    <script>
      const orb = document.getElementById('orb');
      document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {
        if (orb) orb.style.transform = `translate(${e.clientX - 250}px, ${e.clientY - 250}px)`;
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
